  <div class="tags">
    <span class="tag tag-purple">Developer Skills</span>
    <span class="tag tag-cyan">AI Tooling</span>
    <span class="tag tag-green">Interactive</span>
    <span class="tag tag-amber">Practical Guide</span>
  </div>
  <h1>The Productivity Trap: Staying Relevant as a Software Engineer in the AI Era</h1>
  <p class="lead">AI coding tools genuinely make you faster — studies show 55.8% shorter task times. But research also shows that <em>passive</em> use quietly degrades the conceptual understanding, debugging ability, and design intuition you'll need to advance. Here's how to capture the productivity gain without paying the skill cost.</p>
  <div class="post-hero-meta">
    <span>June 16, 2026</span>
    <span>~14 min read</span>
    <span>Synthesis: 6 research papers</span>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-links">
    <a class="hero-btn" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.20245" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
